raw_text = "~ start
Mama: Please, baby... Mama needs that money for the medicine right now, I'm getting worse!
Mama: Don't ignore your sick Mama, I feel so weak...
Mama: I'm pleading with you... the bills are piling up, send $15,213 before it's too late.
Mama: Baby please, Mama is suffering so much!
Mama: How can you sleep knowing your Mama needs help so badly?
Mama: I'm begging you... I don't know how much longer I can hold on without that money.
=> END"
